ComicCraft – Project Design

1. Project Title

ComicCraft – AI Comic Story Creator Using Gemini Models

2. Project Objective

ComicCraft is an AI-powered web application that helps users create comic stories automatically using Gemini AI models. Users provide a story idea, characters, genre, or theme, and the system generates a structured comic story with dialogue, scenes, and descriptions.

3. Proposed System

The system allows users to:

Enter a story idea or prompt.

Select a comic genre/theme.

Generate a complete story using Gemini.

Create characters and dialogues.

Divide the story into comic panels/scenes.

Edit the generated content.

Preview the comic.

Save or export the final comic.


