5. Main Modules

1. User Management

User registration/login

Profile management

Saved comics


2. Story Input Module

Story prompt

Genre selection

Character information

Number of panels/pages


3. AI Story Generation

Sends the prompt to Gemini

Generates plot

Creates scenes

Generates character dialogues

Maintains story consistency


4. Comic Panel Generation

Converts the generated story into individual panels.

Each panel contains:

Scene description

Character actions

Dialogue

Caption



5. Comic Editor

Edit dialogues

Modify scenes

Rearrange panels

Add/remove characters


6. Preview Module

Displays the completed comic.

Provides page-by-page preview.


7. Export Module

Save comic

Export as PDF/image

Download the finished comic


6. Technologies

Component	Technology

Frontend	HTML, CSS, JavaScript
UI Framework	React.js (optional)
Backend	Python / Node.js
AI Model	Google Gemini API
Database	Firebase / MongoDB / MySQL
Image Generation	Gemini-compatible image generation service/model, if enabled
Authentication	Firebase Authentication
Hosting	Firebase / Vercel / Render


