9. Functional Requirements

User can create an account.

User can enter a story prompt.

User can select a genre.

System generates a story using Gemini.

System generates panel-wise content.

User can edit generated content.

User can preview the comic.

User can save and export comics.


10. Non-Functional Requirements

Performance: Generate results within reasonable response time.

Security: Protect user accounts and API credentials.

Scalability: Support multiple users and comics.

Usability: Simple and beginner-friendly interface.

Reliability: Handle API failures and invalid prompts gracefully.


11. Advantages

Makes comic creation easier.

Reduces the time required to develop stories.

Helps users who have limited writing skills.

Automatically generates creative ideas and dialogues.

Provides an interactive comic-creation experience.

Can be used by students, writers, and comic enthusiasts.


12. Future Enhancements

AI-generated comic artwork.

Voice-to-story input.

Multiple languages.

Character voice generation.

AI character consistency across panels.

Animation/video conversion.

Online comic sharing and collaboration.

Mobile application.


13. Project Workflow

User Input → Prompt Processing → Gemini AI → Story Generation → Panel Generation → Comic Editing → Preview → Export

